	<div class="par parsys"><div class="title section"><h1 class="page-title">Facsimile/Reference Ballots</h1>
</div>
<div class="image parbase section"><div id="cq-image-jsp-/content/rov/en/elections/facsimile/jcr:content/par/image_2136141617"><img src="/content/rov/en/elections/facsimile/_jcr_content/par/image_2136141617.img.jpg/1696603522330.jpg" alt="rov-line" title="rov-line" class="cq-dd-image"></div>
    
    
<script type="text/javascript">
    (function() {
        var imageDiv = document.getElementById("cq\u002Dimage\u002Djsp\u002D\/content\/rov\/en\/elections\/facsimile\/jcr:content\/par\/image_2136141617");
        var imageEvars = '{ imageLink: "", imageAsset: "/content/dam/rov/shared/rov-line.jpg", imageTitle: "rov\u002Dline" }';
        var tagNodes = imageDiv.getElementsByTagName('A');
        for (var i = 0; i < tagNodes.length; i++) {
            var link = tagNodes.item(i); 
            link.setAttribute('onclick', 'CQ_Analytics.record({event: "imageClick", values: ' + imageEvars + ', collect: false, options: { obj: this }, componentPath: "foundation\/components\/image"})');
        }
        
    })();
</script>

</div>
<div class="text parbase section">
<p>Facsimile/Reference Ballots are available in Spanish, Filipino,
  Vietnamese, Chinese, Arabic, Farsi, Hindi, Hmong, Indonesian,
  Japanese, Khmer, Korean, Lao, Somali, and Thai. In addition, hardcopy
  Facsimile/Reference Ballots are available at all vote centers in San
  Diego County.</p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/english-reference-ballot.pdf">Facsimile/Reference Ballot</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/spanish-reference-ballot.pdf">Facsímil/Boleta
    de Referencia</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/filipino-reference-ballot.pdf">Kopya/Reperensiya
    ng Balota</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/vietnamese-reference-ballot.pdf">Lá
    Phiếu Phiên Bản Mẫu/Tham Khảo</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/chinese-reference-ballot.pdf">選票摹本/ 參照選票</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/arabic-reference-ballot.pdf">بطاقة
    الاقتراع المرجعية/المرسلة بالفاكس</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/japanese-reference-ballot.pdf">ファクシミリ／参照用投票用紙</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/korean-reference-ballot.pdf">팩시밀리/참고용 투표지</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/laotian-reference-ballot.pdf">ບັດລົງຄະແນນສຽງທາງໂທລະສານ/ບັດລົງຄະແນນສຽງອ້າງອີງ</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/farsi-reference-ballot.pdf">برگه
    رای فاکسیمیلی/مرجع</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/somali-reference-ballot.pdf">DAABACAADA/TIXRAACA
    WARQADA CODBIXINTA</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/hindi-reference-ballot.pdf">संदर्भ मतपत्र</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/hmong-reference-ballot.pdf">DAIM
    NTAWV POV NTAWV QAUV / SIV UA KEV SIV</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/indonesian-reference-ballot.pdf">FAKSIMILI/REFERENSI
    SURAT SUARA</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/khmer-reference-ballot.pdf">សន្លឹកបោះឆ្នោតគំរូ</a></p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/facsimile-reference-ballot/thai-reference-ballot.pdf">บัตรเลือกตั้งฉบับอ้างอิง/ฉบับแปล</a></p>
 <p>A list of State and County covered languages by precinct is located
  in the <a href="/content/dam/rov/en/election/nov-3-2026-gubernatorial-general-election/state-and-county-covered-languages-by-precinct.pdf">State
    and County Covered Languages by Precinct PDF</a>. Visit our <a href="/content/rov/en/outreach/language-assistance.html">Language
    Assistance webpage</a> for more information.</p>

</div>
<div class="image parbase section"><div id="cq-image-jsp-/content/rov/en/elections/facsimile/jcr:content/par/image_2136141617_cop"><img src="/content/rov/en/elections/facsimile/_jcr_content/par/image_2136141617_cop.img.jpg/1696603522330.jpg" alt="rov-line" title="rov-line" class="cq-dd-image"></div>
    
    
